<title>INDIA: India ONGC 96/97 crude output 28.7 mln T.</title>
<headline>India ONGC 96/97 crude output 28.7 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian state-run Oil and Natural Gas Corp (ONGC) said on Monday it produced 28.7 million tonnes of crude oil in 1996/97 (April-March).  </p>
<p>ONGC produced 1,128 million tonnes of liquified petroleum gas in 1996/97 which was 113 percent of the target set for the year, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
